    },
    {
      "text": "One reads, \"God above increase our love.\"",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Increase our love",
        "sub": "\"God above increase our love\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Another says, \"I am yours.\"",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "I am yours",
        "sub": "A ring in London's V&A"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A third promises, \"United hearts death only parts.\"",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "United hearts",
        "sub": "\"Death only parts\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The word poesy comes from the French word for poetry.",
      "say": "The word poesy comes from the French word for poetry.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Poésie",
        "sub": "French for poetry"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Hamlet, Shakespeare mentions \"the posy of a ring\" as something brief.",
